# What the guide worker's image (worker/Dockerfile) never contains: keys, host data, Wi-Fi, other sites' builds.
# The image needs the engine (scripts, i18n, templates) and the worker; nothing else.
.git
**/node_modules
.env
**/.env*
worker/.env.local
worker/jobs
test-submissions
archive
onboarding-site
sites/*
!sites/README.md
docs
**/*.zip
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.claude
